<% layout("/layouts-ejs_mate/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-8 offset-2">
        <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Last updated: August 2026</p>
        <hr>

        <h5>1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p>When you create an account on KASUT, we collect your username, email address, and password (stored in hashed form). When you create listings, we store the listing details and uploaded images. When you leave reviews, we store the review content along with your user reference.</p>

        <h5>2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
        <p>We use your information to provide and maintain the KASUT platform, display your listings and reviews to other users, enable account authentication and session management, and communicate important updates about your account.</p>

        <h5>3. Data Storage</h5>
        <p>Your data is stored securely in our MongoDB database. Uploaded images are stored via Cloudinary's cloud storage service. Sessions are encrypted and stored server-side.</p>

        <h5>4. Third-Party Services</h5>
        <p>We use the following third-party services: Cloudinary for image storage and optimization, Bootstrap CDN for frontend styling, and Google Fonts for typography.</p>

        <h5>5. Your Rights</h5>
        <p>You can edit or delete your listings at any time. You can delete reviews you have authored. You can request account deletion by contacting us.</p>

        <h5>6. Contact</h5>
        <p>For any privacy-related questions, please reach out to us at privacy@kasut.com.</p>
    </div>
</div>
